<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Doctor Application Approved</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
    
    <h2 style="color: #2e7d32; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      Doctor Application Approved
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
      Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
      Congratulations! Your application to become a doctor on our platform has been
      <strong style="color: #2e7d32;">approved</strong>.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
      You can now access your doctor account and start using the platform.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555;">
      Thank you for joining us.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px; color: #333;">
      Best regards,<br />
      <strong>Healthcare Team</strong>
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>